opublicationDate`“»|granking#Wcrfcd9047irfcNumber#WestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlexIPropagation of ARP/ND Flags in an Ethernet Virtual Private Network (EVPN)dtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractyåThe Babel information model provides structured data elements for a Babel implementation reporting its current state and may allow limited configuration of some such data elements.  This information model can be used as a basis for creating data models under various data modeling regimes.  This information model only includes parameters and parameter values useful for managing Babel over IPv6.fadNamepMartin Vigoureuxdarea£gacronymcrtgdfullrrtg - Routing AreadnamelRouting AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliationdAT&TdnamehB. Stark¢kaffiliationnKloud ServicesdnameoM. Jethanandaniddatej÷õhfilenamegrfc9046eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymebabeldfullxbabel - Babel routing protocoldnamevBabel routing protocoldtypebwgbidjdoc-130848hkeywordsÅeBabelkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate`›granking#Vcrfcd9046irfcNumber#VestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlewBabel Information ModeldtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractx‚This document updates the cryptographic algorithm requirements for the Password-Based Message Authentication Code in the Internet X.509 Public Key Infrastructure Certificate Request Message Format (CRMF) specified in RFC 4211.fadNamemRoman Danyliwdarea£gacronymcsecdfullssec - Security AreadnamemSecurity AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationnVigil SecuritydnamejR. Housleyddatej÷úhfilenamegrfc9045eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymelampsdfullx8lamps - Limited Additional Mechanisms for PKIX and SMIMEdnamex0Limited Additional Mechanisms for PKIX and SMIMEdtypebwgbidjdoc-130847hkeywordsÉnAuthenticationxMessage Authentication Codex*Password-Based Message Authentication CodekobsoletedByÄepages	opublicationDate`øıˇgranking#Ucrfcd9045irfcNumber#Uesta