This memo updates Section 26.4 of RFC 2544.fadNamemWarren Kumaridarea£gacronymcopsdfullx$ops - Operations and Management AreadnamexOperations and Management AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationiAT&T LabsdnameiA. Mortonddatej÷Ühfilenamegrfc9004eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdbmwgdfullxbmwg - Benchmarking MethodologydnamexBenchmarking Methodologydtypebwgbidjdoc-130806hkeywordsÉkBuffer sizelBuffer delayqCorrection FactorkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate`Ø»granking#,crfcd9004irfcNumber#,estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex8Updates for the Back-to-Back Frame Benchmark in RFC 2544dtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractyßThis document enhances the BGP Cease NOTIFICATION message "Administrative Shutdown" and "Administrative Reset" subcodes for operators to transmit a short free-form message to describe why a BGP session was shut down or reset.  This document updates RFC 4486 and obsoletes RFC 8203 by defining an Extended BGP Administrative Shutdown Communication of up to 255 octets to improve communication using multibyte character sets.fadNamemAlvaro Retanadarea£gacronymcrtgdfullrrtg - Routing AreadnamelRouting AreagauthorsÑ¢kaffiliationcNTTdnamekJ. Snijders¢kaffiliationeCiscodnamehJ. Heitz¢kaffiliationgJuniperdnamejJ. Scudder¢kaffiliationfYandexdnameiA. Azimovddatej÷ãhfilenamegrfc9003eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymcidrdfullxidr - Inter-Domain RoutingdnametInter-Domain Routingdtypebwgbidjdoc-130805hkeywordsÉcBGPeceasehshutdownkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate_¯æ˘granking#+crfcd9003irfcNumber#+estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex2Extended BGP Administrative Shutdown CommunicationdtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractxRThis document describes loss detection and congestion control mechanisms for QUIC.fadNameqMagnus Westerlunddarea£gacronymcwitdfullx wit - Web and Internet TransportdnamexWeb and Internet TransportgauthorsÇ¢k