ppdfullwapp - Applications AreadnameqApplications Areadtypedareabidjdoc-128028hkeywordsÑdSOAPcJMSdJNDIcIRIkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDateM∏®grankingcrfcd6167irfcNumberestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex+URI Scheme for Java(tm) Message Service 1.0dtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractyâThis document provides instructions to IANA for the creation of a registry for PIM message types. It specifies the initial content of the registry, based on existing RFCs specifying PIM message types. It also specifies a procedure for registering new types.

