 AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationuCNRS/LIMOS LaboratorydnamehM. Badraddatej‘Fhfilenamegrfc5487eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymctlsdfullxtls - Transport Layer SecuritydnamexTransport Layer Securitydtypebwgbidjdoc-127374hkeywordsácPSKnDiffie-HellmanlKey Exchangexadvanced encryption standardcgcmpdigest algorithmkciphersuitekobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDateI∂≠ßgrankingocrfcd5487irfcNumberoestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlexQPre-Shared Key Cipher Suites for TLS with SHA-256/384 and AES Galois Counter ModedtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractxªThis document defines the terminology that is to be used in describing Session PEERing for Multimedia INTerconnect (SPEERMINT).  This memo provides information for the Internet community.fadNamelJon Petersondarea£gacronymcraidfullx4rai - Real-time Applications and Infrastructure Areadnamex.Real-time Applications and Infrastructure AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliationiCableLabsdnamehD. Malas¢kaffiliation`dnamehD. MeyerddatejÃøhfilenamegrfc5486eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymispeermintdfullx7speermint - Session PEERing for Multimedia INTerconnectdnamex+Session PEERing for Multimedia INTerconnectdtypebwgbidjdoc-127373hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÄepages
