relaying service for application layer programs.fadNameiNed Freeddarea£gacronymcappdfullwapp - Applications AreadnameqApplications AreagauthorsÉ¢kaffiliationxDover Beach Consulting, Inc.dnamegM. Rose¢kaffiliationvClearswift CorporationdnamehG. Klyne¢kaffiliationxBrandenburg InternetWorkingdnamejD. Crockerddatej“Fhfilenamegrfc3340eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdapexdfullxapex - Application ExchangednametApplication Exchangedtypebwgbidjdoc-125297hkeywordsÇdAPEXxApplication Exchange CorekobsoletedByÄepages(opublicationDate=?5Ágrankingcrfcd3340irfcNumberestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamehHistoricdslugdhistfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlexThe Application Exchange CoredtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractxπThis document defines a date and time format for use in Internet protocols that is a profile of the ISO 8601 standard for representation of dates and times using the Gregorian calendar.fadNameiNed Freeddarea£gacronymcappdfullwapp - Applications AreadnameqApplications AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliationvClearswift CorporationdnamehG. Klyne¢kaffiliationpSun MicrosystemsdnameiC. Newmanddatej“Fhfilenamegrfc3339eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedıegroup§gacronymdimppdfullx.impp - Instant Messaging and Presence Protocoldnamex'Instant Messaging and Presence Protocoldtypebwgbidjdoc-125296hkeywordsÑjTimestampsrgregorian calendarcisox.International Organization for StandardizationkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate=?5^grankingcrfcd3339irfcNumberestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex)Date and Time on the Internet: TimestampsdtypecrfciupdatedByÅd9557∂habstractyªThis document specifies a mechanism of dual stack hosts using a
technique called 'Bump-in-the-API'(BIA) which allows for the hosts to
communicate with other IPv6 hosts using existing IPv4 applications. The
goal of this mechanism is the same as that of the Bump-in-the-stack
mechanism [BIS], but this mechanism provides the translation method
between the IPv4 APIs and IPv6 APIs. Thus, the goal is simply achieved
without IP header translation.fadNamejRandy Bushdarea£gacronymcopsdfullx$ops - Operations and Management AreadnamexOperations and Management AreagauthorsÖ¢kaffiliationdETRIdnamefS. Lee¢kaffiliationdETRIdnameiM-K. Shin¢kaffiliationdETRIdnamehY-J. Kim¢kaffiliationpSun MicrosystemsdnamekE. Nordmark¢kaffiliationpSun MicrosystemsdnameiA. Durandddatej”hfilenamegrfc3338eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymgngtransdfullx$ngtrans - Next Generation TransitiondnamexNext Generation Transitiondtypebwgbidjdoc-125295hkeywordsÇcBIAoBump-in-the-APIkobsoletedByÅd6535epagesopublicationDate=§∂~granking
