rning algorithms and policies for predictive reservations. [STANDARDS-TRACK]darea£gacronymctsvdfullttsv - Transport AreadnamenTransport AreagauthorsÑ¢kaffiliationmCisco SystemsdnamehF. Baker¢kaffiliationmCisco SystemsdnamelC. Iturralde¢kaffiliationmCisco SystemsdnamenF. Le Faucheur¢kaffiliationmCisco SystemsdnamehB. Davieddatej”1hfilenamegrfc3175eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedıegroup§gacronymeisslldfullx5issll - Integrated Services over Specific Link Layersdnamex-Integrated Services over Specific Link Layersdtypebwgbidjdoc-125140hkeywordsÖdRSVPxresource reservation protocolhinternetcATMxasynchronous transfer modekobsoletedByÄepages$opublicationDate;êápgrankinggcrfcd3175irfcNumbergestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex2Aggregation of RSVP for IPv4 and IPv6 ReservationsdtypecrfciupdatedByÅd5350¥habstractx»The purpose of this document is to make the SHA-1 (Secure Hash Algorithm 1) hash algorithm conveniently available to the Internet community.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.gauthorsÇ¢kaffiliationhMotoroladnameoD. Eastlake 3rd¢kaffiliationmCisco SystemsdnamehP. Jonesddatej”1hfilenamegrfc3174eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedıegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbidjdoc-125139hkeywordsÖdFIPSgfederalkinformationjprocessinghstandardkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate;êápgrankingfcrfcd3174irfcNumberfestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamecISEdslugciseetitlex!US Secure Hash Algorithm 1 (SHA1)dtypecrfciupdatedByÇd6234d4634µhabstractxôThis document describes a protocol intended to provide lossless compression for Internet Protocol datagrams in an Internet environment. [STANDARDS-TRACK]darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÑ¢kaffiliationpJuniper NetworksdnamejA. Shacham¢kaffiliationdUCSBdnamejB. Monsour¢kaffiliationfSprintdnamejR. Pereira¢kaffiliat