mmands. [STANDARDS-TRACK]darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliation`dnamejG. Neufeld¢kaffiliation`dnamegJ. Baerddatej“?hfilenamegrfc2369eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbidjdoc-124364hkeywordsÖcURLxuniform resource locatoreemailfheaderffieldskobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate5ôﬁpgranking	Acrfcd2369irfcNumber	AestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnameqProposed Standarddslugbpsfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlexlThe Use of URLs as Meta-Syntax for Core Mail List Commands and their Transport through Message Header FieldsdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractxÄThis document defines the format of Uniform Resource Locators (URL) for designating electronic mail addresses. [STANDARDS-TRACK]darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÉ¢kaffiliationxInternet Mail ConsortiumdnamejP. Hoffman¢kaffiliationqXerox CorporationdnamekL. Masinter¢kaffiliationwNetscape CommunicationsdnamekJ. Zawinskiddatej“?hfilenamegrfc2368eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbidjdoc-124363hkeywordsÖiURLMAILTOxuniform resource locatorjelectronicdmailiaddresseskobsoletedByÅd6068epages
