cess TypedtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstracty+The Multipart/Related content-type provides a common mechanism for representing objects that are aggregates of related MIME body parts.  This document defines the Multipart/Related content-type and provides examples of its use.  This memo defines an Experimental Protocol for the Internet community.darea£gacronymcappdfullwapp - Applications AreadnameqApplications AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationx"Accurate Information Systems, Inc.dnamekE. Levinsonddatej—ƒhfilenamegrfc1872eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymhmimesgmldfullx/mimesgml - MIME Content-Type for SGML Documentsdnamex$MIME Content-Type for SGML Documentsdtypebwgbidjdoc-123905hkeywordsÑlmultipurposehInternetdMailjExtensionskobsoletedByÅd2112epagesopublicationDate0æ∂␀grankingPcrfcd1872irfcNumberPestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamelExperimentaldslugcexpfstream¢dnamedIETFdslugdietfetitlex'The MIME Multipart/Related Content-typedtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstracty:This document describes a modification to the IETF procedures to allow an escape from a situation where the existing procedures are not working or do not seem to apply.  This document specifies an Internet Best Current Practices for the Internet Community, and requests discussion and suggestions for improvements.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationcISIdnameiJ. Postelddatej“◊hfilenamegrfc1871eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbidjdoc-123904hkeywordsÖcBCPbWGfescapefclausejprocedureskobsoletedByÅd2026epagesopublicationDate0ó)␀grankingOcrfcd1871irfcNumberOestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamehHistoricdslugdhistfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlex*Addendum to RFC 1602 -- Variance ProceduredtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractx˛This memo defines an extension to the SMTP service whereby an SMTP client and server may interact to give the server an opportunity to d