x,Transmitting IP traffic over ARCNET networksdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstracty”This memo describes the state of standardization of protocols used in the Internet as determined by the Internet Activities Board (IAB).  An overview of the standards procedures is presented first, followed by discussions of the standardization process and the RFC document series, then the explanation of the terms is presented, the lists of protocols in each stage of standardization follows, and finally pointers to references and contacts for further information.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliationkunspecifieddnamex)Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency¢kaffiliation`dnamexInternet Activities Boardddatej—hhfilenamegrfc1200eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-43064hkeywordsÑcIABhofficialhprotocolistandardskobsoletedByÅd1250epagesopublicationDate'ˆËÄgranking∞crfcd1200irfcNumber∞estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamehHistoricdslugdhistfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlexIAB official protocol standardsdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstract`darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationx"USC Information Sciences InstitutednamekJ. Reynoldsddatej—Ωhfilenamegrfc1199eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-43103hkeywordsÇgSummarycRFCkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate)8ñÄgrankingØcrfcd1199irfcNumberØestateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlex-Request for Comments Summary Notes: 1100-1199dtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractx∫This FYI RFC provides pointers to the published standards of the MIT X Consortium.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.  It does not specify any Internet standard.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General Areadnamel