ement Protocol (SNMP).  This memo describes an Experimental Protocol for the Internet community, and requests discussion and suggestions for improvements.  This memo does not specify a standard for the Internet community.  Please refer to the current edition of the "IAB Official Protocol Standards" for the standardization state and status of this protocol.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÉ¢kaffiliation`dnameiM.T. Rose¢kaffiliation`dnamemK. McCloghrie¢kaffiliation`dnamejJ.R. Davinddatej“Úhfilenamegrfc1187eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-43097hkeywordsÅiSNMP-BULKkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate'Èpgranking£crfcd1187irfcNumber£estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamelExperimentaldslugcexpfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlex"Bulk Table Retrieval with the SNMPdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractx This RFC is the specification of the MD4 Digest Algorithm.  If you are going to implement MD4, it is suggested you do it this way.  This memo is for informational use and does not constitute a standard.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliation`dnamekR.L. RivestddatejÀhfilenamegrfc1186eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-43096hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÅd1320epagesopublicationDate'Èpgranking¢crfcd1186irfcNumber¢estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamemInformationaldslugcinffstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlexMD4 Message Digest AlgorithmdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractyThis memo describes an Experimental Protocol extension to TCP for the Internet community, and requests discussion and suggestions for improvements.  Please refer to the current edition of the "IAB Official Protocol Standards" for the standardization state and status of this protocol.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General Area