 The relative benefits of the different approaches are reviewed.  Discussions and comments are explicitly encouraged to move toward the best policy based routing model that scales well within a large internetworking environment.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliation`dnamejH.W. Braunddatej  hfilenamegrfc1104eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-43038hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÄepages
