stractyThis RFC discusses the motivation for use of "trailer encapsulations" on local-area networks and describes the implementation of such an encapsulation on various media.  This document is for information only.  This is NOT an official protocol for the ARPA Internet community.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÇ¢kaffiliation`dnamejS. Leffler¢kaffiliation`dnamekM.J. Karelsddatej»øhfilenamefrfc893eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-42823hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDateÕ.Ägranking}crfcc893irfcNumber}estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamegUnknowndslugdunknfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlevTrailer encapsulationsdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractx‡This is a draft version of the transport protocol being standardized by the ISO.  This version also appeared in the ACM SIGCOMM Computer Communication Review (V.12, N.3-4) July-October 1982.  This version is now out of date.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationkunspecifieddnamex.International Organization for Standardizationddatej…>hfilenamefrfc892eflags£mhiddenDefaultıiobsoletedıgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-42821hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÅc905epagesRopublicationDate,WÄgranking|crfcc892irfcNumber|estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamegUnknowndslugdunknfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlex$ISO Transport Protocol specificationdtypecrfciupdatedByÄ∂habstractxÂThis RFC provides a description of the DCN protocols for maintaining connectivity, routing, and clock information in a local network.  These procedures may be of interest to the designers and implementers of other local networks.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliation`dnamejD.L. Millsddatej—ºhfilenamefrfc891eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupd