n", where the domain itself can be further strutured.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliation`dnameiJ. Postelddatej…whfilenamefrfc805eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-42724hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDateª≠Ägranking%crfcc805irfcNumber%estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamegUnknowndslugdunknfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlexComputer mail meeting notesdtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractxpThis is the CCITT standard for group 3 facsimile encoding.  This is useful for data compression of bit map data.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÅ¢kaffiliationkunspecifieddnamexiInternational Telegraph and Telephone Consultative Committee of the International Telecommunication Unionddatej»©hfilenamefrfc804eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-42723hkeywordsÄkobsoletedByÄepagesopublicationDate±õÄgranking$crfcc804irfcNumber$estateÅiPublishedfstatus¢dnamegUnknowndslugdunknfstream¢dnamefLegacydslugflegacyetitlexCCITT draft recommendation T.4dtypecrfciupdatedByÄµhabstractyjThe first part of this RFC describes in detail the Dacom 450 data compression algorithms and is an update and correction to an earlier memorandum.  The second part of this RFC describes briefly the Dacom 500 data compression algorithm as used by the INTELPOST electronic-mail network under development by the US Postal Service and several foreign administrators.darea£gacronymcgendfullrgen - General AreadnamelGeneral AreagauthorsÉ¢kaffiliation`dnamejA. Agarwal¢kaffiliation`dnamemM.J. O'Connor¢kaffiliation`dnamejD.L. Millsddatej ‡hfilenamefrfc803eflags£mhiddenDefaultÙiobsoletedÙgupdatedÙegroup§gacronymdnonedfullxnone - Individual SubmissionsdnamevIndividual Submissionsdtypegindividbididoc-42722hkeywords